---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Economy for Everyone"
  description="Economic dignity, guardrails, and practical action."
>
  <section>
    <div class="hero">
      <div class="hero-grid">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Start With What People Are Actually Feeling</p>
          <h2 class="hero-title hero-title-tight">Economic dignity for real life</h2>
          <p class="hero-subtitle hero-subtitle-wide">
            Economy for Everyone is a narrative-first publication: lived experience first, receipts
            second, practical action third. It is built to make structural problems clear without
            becoming policy blather.
          </p>
          <div class="hero-chips">
            <span class="chip">Facts, not vibes</span>
            <span class="chip">Bridges, not dunks</span>
            <span class="chip">One small action</span>
          </div>
          <div class="cta-row">
            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/origin-story">Origin Story</a>
            <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/core-model">Core Model</a>
            <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/playbooks">Playbooks</a>
            <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/blog">Blogs</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <aside class="hero-panel">
          <p class="eyebrow">How To Read This</p>
          <p>1. Begin with the <a href="/origin-story">origin story</a>.</p>
          <p>2. Follow the <a href="/core-model">core model</a> in plain language.</p>
          <p>3. Use <a href="/playbooks">playbooks</a> for practical action.</p>
          <p>
            4. Use <a href="/case-studies">case studies</a> as supporting research and feedback loop.
          </p>
          <p>
            5. Read the <a href="/blog">blog</a> for current thinking (and occasional author musings).
          </p>
          <p class="eyebrow">Signature Line</p>
          <p>Be humble. Be kind. Be useful - and stay awake.</p>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
